---@field view? gcp.unstable.assuredworkloads_v1beta1.ListOrganizationsLocationsWorkloadsViolationsViewEnum|string Optional. The violation view (`VIOLATION_VIEW_ASSURED_WORKLOADS` or `VIOLATION_VIEW_DATA_BOUNDARY`) to list violations for. If not specified, `VIOLATION_VIEW_ASSURED_WORKLOADS` is used.
---@field parent string Required. The workload to list violations for. To list violations across all workloads in an organization, use `-` as the workload ID. When `view` is `VIOLATION_VIEW_DATA_BOUNDARY`, violations are listed for the entire organization and location, and the workload ID is ignored. Format: `organizations/{organization}/locations/{location}/workloads/{workload}`
